# The play scripts' end (play_N.kps): the game's state and sound logged, the music playing; paused, the terrain's
# check (the view without the images and the fog: every megatile, creep's edges included, as the game shows it now),
# then the fog's (the view without and with the fog) and the palette pass's over the fogged view.
log play tick selected units:0 units:1 units:2 units:3 units:4 units:5 units:6 units:7
log sound sounds.started sounds.streamed music.track music.playing
state play
expect music.playing == 1
pause
fog off &
world off
wait frames 3
check terrain "after the play"
log creep creep.tiles creep.receding
world on
wait frames 3
check fog-plain
fog on
wait frames 3
check fog
check palette
shot play
resume
